OL,3,GNEWSAAirport lights set to return as
OL,4,Apart of reopening
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlanning permission to install approach
OL,7,Flights at Doncaster Sheffield Airport
OL,8,Fhas been submitted by City of Doncaster
OL,9,FCouncil.
OL,11,FIt comes after it was revealed that
OL,12,FSouth Yorkshire Mayoral Combined
OL,13,FAuthority would buy the airport and
OL,14,Fadjacent land subject to a deal with
OL,15,Flandowner Peel Group going through.
OL,17,FThe airport closed in November 2022 and
OL,18,Fsince then the council has been working
OL,19,Fto reopen it with public funds after
OL,20,Fattempts to find a private operator
OL,21,Ffailed.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
