OL,3,GNEWSAAirport lights set to return as
OL,4,Apart of reopening
OL,5,
OL,6,FSimon Hinchley, from Fly Doncaster Ltd,
OL,7,Fthe arm's-length company set up by the
OL,8,Fcouncil to run the airport, said:
OL,9,F"Reinstalling approach lighting is
OL,10,Fanother important step towards the
OL,11,Foperational readiness of this airport."
